# Cloudflare Pages redirect rules. Consumed at deploy time, never served.
#
# Cloudflare publishes outputs/ as the site root, so live URLs carry no
# /outputs/ prefix. Deployments before wrangler.toml served the repository root
# instead, so links shared back then still include it. Unmatched paths fall
# through to the homepage with a 200, which hides the breakage rather than
# fixing it, so map the old prefix away permanently.
/outputs/* /:splat 301

# OpsBoard moved from a static copy embedded in this site to its own Worker
# deployment, which is where accounts, saved work, and the PM Assistant live.
# Old links and bookmarks keep working.
/tools/techniek-opsboard/* https://opsboard.techniekengineering.com/ 301
